Daze Wallbox Integration for Home Assistant
===========================================

Original author
---------------

Created by Andrea Restello (@arest).
Upstream project: https://github.com/arest/daze-addon

The integration architecture, config flow, entity model, sensor catalog
and API client are his work, including the reverse engineering of the
Daze web API, which the vendor does not publish.

This repository
---------------

A fork maintained by Pedro Tarrinho (@tarrinho) at
https://github.com/tarrinho/daze-addon

The changes in this fork are the work of Pedro Tarrinho. They are bug
fixes found by running the integration against a DT01 charger and
measuring the API's actual responses: authentication, payload parsing,
charge command shape and retry behaviour, state reporting, and
diagnostics.

It is not a redesign, and it carries no claim over the original work.
See the "Changes in this fork" section of README.md for the detail.

